  {
    "id": "visitor.v3.taizhou-suzhou.transport-tickets",
    "topic": "transport",
    "cities": [
      "taizhou-zhejiang",
      "suzhou-anhui"
    ],
    "text_zh": "在浙江台州或安徽宿州乘坐中国内地铁路、高铁时，携带购票所用有效证件原件，按站内指引走自动或人工核验通道；当地公交可向工作人员确认人民币现金等付款方式。本条不表示当地有地铁。",
    "text_en": "For mainland rail or high-speed train travel in Taizhou, Zhejiang, or Suzhou, Anhui, carry the original valid document used to book and follow station guidance for automatic or manual checks. Ask local bus staff about RMB cash and other payment methods. This does not establish that either city has a metro.",
    "source_urls": [
      "https://english.www.gov.cn/2025special/bizexpatsinchina2025"
